      "clause_id": "RES-019",
      "end_character": 486,
      "excerpt": "Artifact Type Resolution is an executable deterministic operation resolve_R(a) over one canonical machine carrier and one exact registry. An explicit exact reference may select an admitted-current or admitted-historical type; discriminator-only evidence selects admitted-current types. The operation returns resolved for exactly one match, unresolved for zero, and ambiguous for multiple distinct matches. Paths, filenames, extensions, and nearest-name similarity are excluded evidence.",
